C5/C6/C7/C8 -- the three-way comparison at FIXED physical radii, five X-COP clusters with weak lensing
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    structural note: in the framework's modified-gravity arm gamma_PPN = 1 (THE_ACTION section 4), so its
    predicted lensing mass EQUALS its predicted dynamical mass identically.  The two shortfalls therefore
    differ if and only if the two MEASURED masses differ: S_lens/S_dyn = M_WL/M_HSE exactly.  That identity
    is why the lensing observable cannot rescue a shortfall already present in the dynamical probe.

